        "text": "=Copying the dashboard template did not work, so no Kit_Sheet_ID was saved.\n\nBrand: {{ $('Loop brands').item.json.Brand_Name }}\nTemplate ID: 1TQax9tFM_cFk8c15Mt60xPcJj3TGqh0ZSP68i1Z6dX4\nError: {{ $json.error ? JSON.stringify($json.error) : ($json.message || 'see the n8n execution log') }}\n\nUsual cause: the template was moved, renamed or trashed. The ID above must point at 'TEMPLATE - Client Reporting Dashboard (Meta + TikTok)'."
      },
