        "text": "=The dashboard was copied but Kit_Sheet_ID could not be written back to the registry.\n\nBrand: {{ $('Loop brands').item.json.Brand_Name }}\nNew sheet ID: {{ $('Copy kit template').item.json.id }}\n\nPaste that ID into the Kit_Sheet_ID column yourself, otherwise this workflow will create a second dashboard for the same brand on its next run. The column must exist and be spelled exactly Kit_Sheet_ID."
      },
